flowchart LR
  F[Foundation] --> S[Semantic]
  S --> C[Component]
  C --> E[Experience]
  F --> F1[Color] & F2[Type] & F3[Spacing] & F4[Shape]
  S --> S1[Surface] & S2[Content] & S3[Action] & S4[Feedback]
  C --> C1[Navigation] & C2[Input] & C3[Status] & C4[Container]
  E --> E1[Default] & E2[Focus] & E3[Disabled] & E4[Error] & E5[Complete]
  %% Rationale: layered tokens preserve consistency and permit controlled adaptation.